{"id":5099,"date":"2023-02-18T15:25:53","date_gmt":"2023-02-18T14:25:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=5099"},"modified":"2023-02-18T15:30:00","modified_gmt":"2023-02-18T14:30:00","slug":"mpy-jama","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2023\/02\/18\/mpy-jama\/","title":{"rendered":"MPY-jama"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>MPY-Jama est un IDE simplifi\u00e9 qui ressemble beaucoup \u00e0 l\u2019environnement Arduino. Ce qui est pratique, ce sont les divers outils qui sont directement disponibles&nbsp;:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Configurateur de r\u00e9seau wifi en mode AP<\/li>\n<li>Configurateur de r\u00e9seau wifi local<\/li>\n<li>Affichage des IO en couleur, rouge=0, vert=1<\/li>\n<li>RAM utilis\u00e9e<\/li>\n<li>Temp\u00e9rature interne du processeur<\/li>\n<li>Terminal REPL<\/li>\n<li>Editeur de code avec coloration syntaxique, mais sans auto compl\u00e9tion&nbsp;!<\/li>\n<li>Un gestionnaire de fichier tr\u00e8s pratique<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY1.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5102\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"986\" height=\"673\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY1.png 986w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY1-300x205.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY1-768x524.png 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY1-130x90.png 130w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 986px) 100vw, 986px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>L\u2019environnement est soign\u00e9, le graphisme agr\u00e9able.<\/p>\n<p>D&rsquo;autres IDE, comme Thonny et Mu, ont d\u00e9j\u00e0 ces fonctionnalit\u00e9s de base. Toutefois, ESP32 MPY-Jama se diff\u00e9rencie gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 une suite d&rsquo;outils appel\u00e9e Jama Funcs. Ces fonctions pr\u00e9d\u00e9finies vous aident \u00e0 configurer votre appareil. De plus, les outils de connexion Wi-Fi facilitent la recherche des r\u00e9seaux disponibles.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY2.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5103\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"984\" height=\"641\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY2.png 984w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY2-300x195.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY2-768x500.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 984px) 100vw, 984px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>L&rsquo;interface graphique comporte un widget dans le coin inf\u00e9rieur gauche qui affiche l&rsquo;utilisation de la RAM, le capteur de temp\u00e9rature et la dur\u00e9e de fonctionnement de la carte.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY3.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5104\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"260\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY3.png 303w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY3-300x257.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 303px) 100vw, 303px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>La section Informations syst\u00e8me fournit des d\u00e9tails suppl\u00e9mentaires qui vous \u00e9vitent d&rsquo;avoir \u00e0 taper des commandes sur le REPL pour voir quelle version de code se trouve sur l&rsquo;appareil. En outre, il donne une lecture en temps r\u00e9el de l&rsquo;\u00e9tat de la broche GPIO.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY5.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5105\" src=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"984\" height=\"641\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY5.png 984w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY5-300x195.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/MPY5-768x500.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 984px) 100vw, 984px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Vous pouvez le <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/jczic\/ESP32-MPY-Jama\">t\u00e9l\u00e9charger sur github depuis ce lien<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Environnement de d\u00e9veloppement micropython<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":5109,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[264],"tags":[11,22],"class_list":["post-5099","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-articles","tag-hardware","tag-programmation"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5099","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5099"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5099\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5107,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5099\/revisions\/5107"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5109"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5099"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5099"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5099"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}